### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### Get Product by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/301

### Filter Products by Category (Case-insensitive)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/filter?category=electronics

### Create New Product
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Water Bottle",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": 299,
  "quantity": 40,
  "inStock": true
}

### Update Product
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/301
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 749,
  "quantity": 20,
  "inStock": true
}

### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/303
